From f27ecba91531b0690f589ea431d7934a5df700ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gspu8ur0j4 <kortneythw.tyquisha@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 01:57:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add bus mixer with effect chains, ducking, snapshots,
 occlusion and save system M1

Mixer: Ambience bus, AudioBusRack with per-bus effect chains and ramped gains, sidechain ducking, named mix snapshots, per-voice occlusion low-pass, master brick-wall limiter. Effects: RBJ biquad low/high-pass, feed-forward compressor, limiter, Freeverb reverb, allocation-free effect chain. Save: SaveArchive (little-endian, versioned section table, unknown-section skip, atomic tmp+rename), SaveManager (slot_N layout, META metadata), ISaveable protocol, CSave facade.
